{"id":"622467","name":"南瓜香豆花卷","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/622467/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"南瓜发面","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香豆粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"勺香豆粉，一勺面粉，适量油，花椒粉调成香豆油酥。","img":"images/622467/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"南瓜面团排气揉圆。","img":"images/622467/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"擀开。","img":"images/622467/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"擀成薄片，撒上薄薄的一层盐。","img":"images/622467/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"抹上香豆油酥。","img":"images/622467/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"从下往上卷起。","img":"images/622467/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"卷好，用手轻轻按压一下。","img":"images/622467/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用刀切成均匀的小剂子。","img":"images/622467/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"取两个小剂子，叠放。","img":"images/622467/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"用筷子从中间压下去。","img":"images/622467/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"捏住两头，挽成花卷。","img":"images/622467/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"花卷饧发20分钟，冷水上锅，中火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/622467/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"蒸好的南瓜香豆花卷。","img":"images/622467/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/622467/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/622467/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}